       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. INTRINSICFUNCS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 A PIC 9(3) VALUE 17.
       01 B PIC 9(3) VALUE 42.
       01 SQUARE-INPUT PIC 9(3) VALUE 81.
       01 REM-RESULT PIC 9(3).
       01 MAX-RESULT PIC 9(3).
       01 MIN-RESULT PIC 9(3).
       01 SQRT-RESULT PIC 9(3)V99.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           COMPUTE REM-RESULT = FUNCTION REM(B, A)
           MOVE FUNCTION MAX(A, B) TO MAX-RESULT
           MOVE FUNCTION MIN(A, B) TO MIN-RESULT
           COMPUTE SQRT-RESULT = FUNCTION SQRT(SQUARE-INPUT)

           DISPLAY "REM(42, 17): " REM-RESULT
           DISPLAY "MAX(17, 42): " MAX-RESULT
           DISPLAY "MIN(17, 42): " MIN-RESULT
           DISPLAY "SQRT(81):    " SQRT-RESULT
           STOP RUN.
